#: .\templates\objectives\index.html:33
msgid "The objectives of PolyQ Database"
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\objectives\index.html:36
msgid "What is this database for?"
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\objectives\index.html:43
msgid ""
"PolyQ Database is a mean to aid in the understanding of polyglutamine "
"diseases."
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\objectives\index.html:44
msgid ""
"As other databases, PolyQ tries to focus on key information and tries "
"conveying it the best way possible."
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\objectives\index.html:45
msgid ""
"This website is a tool for any interested parties with scientific background "
"and knowledge to view general important information on polyglutamine "
"diseases, all in one place."
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\objectives\index.html:51
msgid "Why was this made?"
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\objectives\index.html:59
msgid ""
" Information about polyglutamine disorders is scattered through the "
"internet. One single website regarding the most important\n"
"                information on every polyglutamine disease would prove to be "
"helpful for the science community. "
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\objectives\index.html:66
msgid "What makes this database different from others?"
msgstr ""

#: .\templates\objectives\index.html:79
msgid ""
" Until the date of the creation of this database, there is no other "
"polyglutamine database or rare disease database that includes all general "
"information\n"
"                  about every polyglutamine disease, some focus on the "
"genetic side of the disease, others on therapy among some others.\n"
"                  With the information found from trusted online sources and "
"literature, the most searched information on polyglutamine disorders is "
"consolidated within this website. "
msgstr ""
